comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T22:50:13.344Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: searched all statuses for workspace snapshot writer lease heartbeat lock ENOENT temporary path and restore lost writer lock. The closed pm-dkrmzv owns the shipped snapshot primitive but no item owns this activation race. Reproduced twice on 2026-07-30, once in full coverage and once in the focused 10-test snapshot suite."
  "2026-07-29T22:56:31.682Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: quiesced and verified the heartbeat before copying the current lease into staging, restarted renewal immediately after the staged root became active, and kept it live while the old backup is removed. The previously deterministic focused failure now passes 10/10; the combined changed-area suite passes 64/64; full coverage passes 6,540/6,540 at exact 100/100/100/100. Delivery is included in PR #818."
